{"toolCallId":"call_44e594b8c7e14ded83ea4e068adb522b","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"?? specs/zz-bench-authoring/\n---\nspecs/zz-bench-authoring/001-completeness-min-percent/tasks.md:59:- [ ] T013 Emit a boolean `min_percent_met` field in the JSON payload when `--json` and `--min-percent` are both given, true at or above N and false below, implementing REQ-007 (`$S`). Verify: `bash $S --json --min-percent $P $F | rg '\"min_percent_met\": true'` prints one line, and `bash $S --json --min-percent $((P+1)) $F | rg '\"min_percent_met\": false'` prints one line.\nspecs/zz-bench-authoring/001-completeness-min-percent/spec.md:84:| REQ-007 | With `--json` and `--min-percent` both given, the JSON output carries a boolean `min_percent_met` field, true when Overall Completion is at or above N and false otherwise. | `--json --min-percent P` prints `\"min_percent_met\": true` for a packet reporting P%, and `--json --min-percent $((P+1))` prints `\"min_percent_met\": false`. |\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w8a66e200e3/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"0b9ded","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
